{"4309990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grinnel", "steam_appid": 4309990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/a313afce64068c0a750b6b6876d630d0.avif?t=1779047228\" width=506 height=142 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/c46afa880651e5e14e0a2b3d63449881.poster.avif?t=1779047228\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/c46afa880651e5e14e0a2b3d63449881.webm?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/c46afa880651e5e14e0a2b3d63449881.mp4?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔍 Shifting Reality:</strong> Corridors move every time you turn around. Doors you once passed vanish; you will lose your sense of direction in this living labyrinth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔦 Move or Fade:</strong> The moment you stop, your flashlight dies. The only way to survive in the dark is to never stop moving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👁️ The Price of Paranoia:</strong> Look back too often and your mind blurs, turning everything you see into a hallucination. In this world, your gaze is your greatest weakness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎲 Sinister Randomness:</strong> You never know when the whispers will begin. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/45611732cfe51cf5540d70b2c762e6ef.avif?t=1779047228\" width=938 height=266 /></span>🏥 GRINNEL CLOSED MENTAL HOSPITAL Think back to the events of the past; this is a game of your mind. Remember how we escaped from the hospital? By completing the tasks, of course!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 4 Different Tasks Four different tasks, each with its own purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 Parking Lot Don't forget the key in the parking lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👩‍⚕️ Dr. Esin Help Dr. Esin. Where is the key?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/e6334f787b085166c34a5df5bad57517.poster.avif?t=1779047228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/e6334f787b085166c34a5df5bad57517.webm?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/e6334f787b085166c34a5df5bad57517.mp4?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/fe2faf197f11c1c6d70827bde8d79c94.avif?t=1779047228\" width=1008 height=247 /></span><strong>⚖️ THE COURTROOM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are you, why are you here? The defendant's chair is empty... but everyone is looking at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚖️ Who is this trial for?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grinnel’s name is mentioned, but the crimes described sound familiar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧑‍⚕️ What is Doctor Esin hiding</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness, or part of the experiment? What they say could change at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📜 What is the judge not reading</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some crimes aren't in the files. Some verdicts were decided long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🪑 Why can't you stand up?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a trial. This is a memory you can't escape.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/9c1ccdd036f33be2127b42c82ce617b6.poster.avif?t=1779047228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/9c1ccdd036f33be2127b42c82ce617b6.webm?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/9c1ccdd036f33be2127b42c82ce617b6.mp4?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/373c58164c29c7ce0d35322f1337f7e1.avif?t=1779047228\" width=548 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💻 <strong>LOST FILES AND THE DOCTOR'S VOICE</strong> When you sit at the computer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗂️ Secret files belonging to Grinnel 📝 Deleted patient records 📡 Remote connection with Dr. Esin ❓ Questions with changing answers ⚠️ Evasive, angry, and contradictory responses bring you closer to the true story of the town.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/f756e65f1c1d167bd81a82f412b743be.poster.avif?t=1779047228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/f756e65f1c1d167bd81a82f412b743be.webm?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/f756e65f1c1d167bd81a82f412b743be.mp4?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/a6d97b9995c0953e5846223637f811e9.avif?t=1779047228\" width=1000 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence, cold walls, and uncertainty surround you…  <br>You don’t know where you are, but one thing is certain:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This labyrinth is watching you. </strong> <br>Test your emotions, dive into the darkness, and confront your fears face to face.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/72de27f854d57e356eecd5604d463b34.poster.avif?t=1779047228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/72de27f854d57e356eecd5604d463b34.webm?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/72de27f854d57e356eecd5604d463b34.mp4?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/1042d4760890ee3c522c343bffdf2250.avif?t=1779047228\" width=500 height=132 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 THE CLOWN DOESN’T WANT TO KILL YOU</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its goal isn’t to end your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wants to see your fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It stalks you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It retreats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a psychological experience.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/779dbba39cda23faff5a4d3adea4b087.poster.avif?t=1779047228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/779dbba39cda23faff5a4d3adea4b087.webm?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/235fbd824adc07e3c56b5d6f842c86bc.avif?t=1779047228\" width=500 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ <strong>DEEP WITHIN THE LABYRINTH</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>Throughout the maze, you will encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked doors and coded rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden passages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered clues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of which lead you to the <strong>secret of the basement door</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end, a choice awaits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape… or will you hunt the thing that’s been watching you?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/a671932064b0b9121124161c9bc0478a.poster.avif?t=1779047228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/a671932064b0b9121124161c9bc0478a.webm?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a dark place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence, cold walls, and uncertainty surround you… <br>You don’t know where you are, but one thing is certain:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This labyrinth is watching you. </strong><br>Test your emotions, dive into the darkness, and confront your fears face to face.<br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🩸 <strong>THE STYLE OF HORROR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRINNEL focuses on <strong>atmosphere, psychological tension, and suspense</strong> rather than cheap jumpscares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence is a threat.<br>Darkness is unsafe.<br>And you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 <strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven, single-player horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles and coded rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design and dynamic lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological tension over jumpscares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on player choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/a313afce64068c0a750b6b6876d630d0.avif?t=1779047228\" width=506 height=142 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/c46afa880651e5e14e0a2b3d63449881.poster.avif?t=1779047228\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/c46afa880651e5e14e0a2b3d63449881.webm?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/c46afa880651e5e14e0a2b3d63449881.mp4?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><