team/apps/4309990/extras/72de27f854d57e356eecd5604d463b34.mp4?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/1042d4760890ee3c522c343bffdf2250.avif?t=1779047228\" width=500 height=132 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 THE CLOWN DOESN’T WANT TO KILL YOU</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its goal isn’t to end your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wants to see your fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It stalks you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It retreats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a psychological experience.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/779dbba39cda23faff5a4d3adea4b087.poster.avif?t=1779047228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/779dbba39cda23faff5a4d3adea4b087.webm?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/235fbd824adc07e3c56b5d6f842c86bc.avif?t=1779047228\" width=500 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ <strong>DEEP WITHIN THE LABYRINTH</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>Throughout the maze, you will encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked doors and coded rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden passages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered clues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of which lead you to the <strong>secret of the basement door</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end, a choice awaits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape… or will you hunt the thing that’s been watching you?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/a671932064b0b9121124161c9bc0478a.poster.avif?t=1779047228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/extras/a671932064b0b9121124161c9bc0478a.webm?t=1779047228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a dark place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence, cold walls, and uncertainty surround you… <br>You don’t know where you are, but one thing is certain:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This labyrinth is watching you. </strong><br>Test your emotions, dive into the darkness, and confront your fears face to face.<br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🩸 <strong>THE STYLE OF HORROR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRINNEL focuses on <strong>atmosphere, psychological tension, and suspense</strong> rather than cheap jumpscares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence is a threat.<br>Darkness is unsafe.<br>And you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 <strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven, single-player horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles and coded rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design and dynamic lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological tension over jumpscares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on player choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "If you stop, the light dies. If you turn, darkness takes over. As a patient trapped in Grinnel, escape this psychological horror nightmare with Dr. Esin. Use your visor in the atmospheric labyrinth and never look back; in this surreal thriller, your gaze is your worst enemy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/99806b3726d01426e471dfa78d15378ff565e1de/header.jpg?t=1779047228", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/c290abd86399651f103d705f3cb3f5191f81977e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779047228", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309990/c290abd86399651f103d705f3cb3f5191f81977e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779047228", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 veya AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 650 / AMD R7 250 veya dahili GPU (Intel UHD 630)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX uyumlu ses kartı<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> VR Aygıtları ve Desteği: Yok<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> İlave Notlar: Düşük sistemlerde bile akıcı oynanabilir.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 veya AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><